#: app/insights/messages.py:29
msgid "Presupuesto en observación"
msgstr "Budget under observation"

#: app/insights/messages.py:30
msgid ""
"Monetra aún está aprendiendo de tus primeros meses. Por ahora toma este "
"ritmo de gasto como una referencia inicial."
msgstr ""
"Monetra is still learning from your first few months. For now, take this "
"spending rate as an initial reference."

#: app/insights/messages.py:31
msgid ""
"Con poco historial, una proyección puede cambiar bastante a medida que "
"registres más movimientos."
msgstr ""
"With little history, a projection can change quite a bit as you record "
"more moves."

#: app/insights/messages.py:32
msgid ""
"Sigue registrando tus gastos y revisa si este ritmo se repite durante los"
" próximos meses."
msgstr ""
"Continue recording your expenses and see if this rhythm repeats itself "
"over the next few months."

#: app/insights/messages.py:35
msgid "Ritmo de gasto alto"
msgstr "High spending rate"

#: app/insights/messages.py:36
#, python-brace-format, python-format
msgid ""
"Has usado el {budget_used_pct:.0f}% del presupuesto y solo ha "
"transcurrido el {month_elapsed_pct:.0f}% del mes."
msgstr ""
"You have used {budget_used_pct:.0f}% of the budget and only "
"{month_elapsed_pct:.0f}% of the month has passed."

#: app/insights/messages.py:37
msgid ""
"Tu ritmo actual de gasto indica que podrías superar el presupuesto antes "
"del cierre mensual."
msgstr ""
"Your current spending rate indicates that you could exceed your budget "
"before the monthly close."

#: app/insights/messages.py:38
msgid ""
"Revisa gastos variables o ajusta el presupuesto si este patrón es "
"recurrente."
msgstr ""
"Review variable expenses or adjust the budget if this pattern is "
"recurring."

#: app/insights/messages.py:41
msgid "Vas a superar tu presupuesto"
msgstr "You will exceed your budget"

#: app/insights/messages.py:42
#, python-brace-format, python-format
msgid ""
"Con el ritmo actual cerrarás el mes en {projected_pct:.0f}% del "
"presupuesto."
msgstr ""
"At the current pace you will close the month at {projected_pct:.0f}% "
"budget usage."

#: app/insights/messages.py:43
msgid ""
"La diferencia entre el avance del mes y el consumo del presupuesto es "
"significativa."
msgstr ""
"The difference between the month's progress and budget consumption is "
"significant."

#: app/insights/messages.py:44
msgid "Reduce gastos no esenciales o reasigna presupuesto entre categorías."
msgstr "Reduce non-essential expenses or reallocate budget between categories."

#: app/insights/messages.py:50
msgid "Posible déficit este mes"
msgstr "Possible deficit this month"

#: app/insights/messages.py:51
msgid "Con los datos actuales podrías cerrar el mes con balance negativo."
msgstr "With current data you could close the month with a negative balance."

#: app/insights/messages.py:52
msgid ""
"Monetra todavía está aprendiendo de tu comportamiento. Esta proyección es"
" una orientación inicial, no una conclusión definitiva."
msgstr ""
"Monetra is still learning from your behavior. This projection is an "
"initial orientation, not a definitive conclusion."

#: app/insights/messages.py:53
msgid ""
"Revisa tus próximos gastos e ingresos esperados antes de hacer ajustes "
"fuertes."
msgstr ""
"Review your upcoming expenses and expected income before making harsh "
"adjustments."

#: app/insights/messages.py:56
msgid "Riesgo de déficit mensual"
msgstr "Monthly deficit risk"

#: app/insights/messages.py:57
msgid "Con el ritmo actual podrías cerrar el mes con balance negativo."
msgstr "With the current pace you could close the month with a negative balance."

#: app/insights/messages.py:58
msgid "Los gastos proyectados superan a los ingresos proyectados del periodo."
msgstr "The projected expenses exceed the projected income for the period."

#: app/insights/messages.py:59
msgid "Revisa gastos no esenciales, pagos recurrentes y compromisos pendientes."
msgstr "Review non-essential expenses, recurring payments and pending commitments."

#: app/insights/messages.py:65
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Aumento en {category_name}"
msgstr "Increase in {category_name}"

#: app/insights/messages.py:66
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Este mes llevas {current:.0f}, frente a un promedio histórico de "
"{baseline:.0f}."
msgstr ""
"This month you have {current:.0f}, compared to a historical average of "
"{baseline:.0f}."

#: app/insights/messages.py:67
msgid "El gasto en esta categoría está al menos un 50% por encima del promedio."
msgstr "Spending in this category is at least 50% above average."

#: app/insights/messages.py:68
msgid ""
"Revisa los movimientos de la categoría para confirmar si el aumento es "
"esperado."
msgstr "Review category movements to confirm if the increase is expected."

#: app/insights/messages.py:71
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Aumento fuerte en {category_name}"
msgstr "Strong increase in {category_name}"

#: app/insights/messages.py:72
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Este mes llevas {current:.0f}, el doble o más del promedio histórico."
msgstr ""
"This month you have {current:.0f}, double or more than the historical "
"average."

#: app/insights/messages.py:73
msgid "La desviación es muy superior al patrón habitual de esta categoría."
msgstr "The deviation is much higher than the usual pattern for this category."

#: app/insights/messages.py:74
msgid "Verifica si hay cargos duplicados, suscripciones nuevas o gastos atípicos."
msgstr "Check for duplicate charges, new subscriptions, or unusual expenses."

#: app/insights/messages.py:80
msgid "Movimiento para revisar"
msgstr "Movement to review"

#: app/insights/messages.py:81
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Una transacción de {value:.0f} en {category_name} destaca frente a los "
"datos disponibles."
msgstr ""
"A transaction of {value:.0f} in {category_name} stands out against the "
"available data."

#: app/insights/messages.py:82
msgid ""
"Como aún hay poco historial, Monetra lo muestra como una revisión "
"sugerida y no como una alerta fuerte."
msgstr ""
"Since there is still little history, Monetra shows it as a suggested "
"revision and not a strong alert."

#: app/insights/messages.py:83
msgid "Confirma que el monto y la categoría sean correctos."
msgstr "Confirm that the amount and category are correct."

#: app/insights/messages.py:86
msgid "Transacción inusual detectada"
msgstr "Unusual transaction detected"

#: app/insights/messages.py:87
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Una transacción de {value:.0f} en {category_name} se aleja del patrón "
"habitual."
msgstr ""
"A transaction of {value:.0f} in {category_name} deviates from the usual "
"pattern."

#: app/insights/messages.py:88
msgid ""
"El monto está significativamente por encima del rango típico de la "
"categoría."
msgstr "The amount is significantly above the typical range for the category."

#: app/insights/messages.py:89
msgid "Confirma que la transacción es correcta y que la categoría es la adecuada."
msgstr ""
"Confirm that the transaction is correct and that the category is "
"appropriate."

#: app/insights/messages.py:95
msgid "Ahorro en observación"
msgstr "Savings in observation"

#: app/insights/messages.py:96
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Tu tasa de ahorro este mes es de {savings_rate_pct:.1f}%. Monetra "
"necesita más meses para saber si esto es habitual."
msgstr ""
"Your savings rate this month is {savings_rate_pct:.1f}%. Monetra needs "
"more months to know if this is common."

#: app/insights/messages.py:97
msgid ""
"Durante los primeros meses, el ahorro puede variar mucho por gastos de "
"inicio, compras puntuales o ingresos aún no registrados."
msgstr ""
"During the first months, savings can vary greatly due to startup "
"expenses, specific purchases or income not yet recorded."

#: app/insights/messages.py:98
msgid ""
"Sigue registrando movimientos. Si este patrón se repite, Monetra te "
"avisará con mayor seguridad."
msgstr ""
"Keep recording movements. If this pattern repeats, Monetra will notify "
"you with greater certainty."

#: app/insights/messages.py:101
msgid "Tasa de ahorro baja"
msgstr "Low savings rate"

#: app/insights/messages.py:102
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Tu tasa de ahorro este mes es de {savings_rate_pct:.1f}%."
msgstr "Your savings rate this month is {savings_rate_pct:.1f}%."

#: app/insights/messages.py:103
msgid "Una tasa de ahorro saludable suele estar por encima del 10%."
msgstr "A healthy savings rate is usually above 10%."

#: app/insights/messages.py:104
msgid "Considera revisar gastos variables o establecer una meta de ahorro fija."
msgstr "Consider reviewing variable expenses or setting a fixed savings goal."

#: app/insights/messages.py:107
msgid "Sin capacidad de ahorro"
msgstr "No savings capacity"

#: app/insights/messages.py:108
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Este mes tu balance no permite ahorro (tasa: {savings_rate_pct:.1f}%)."
msgstr ""
"This month your balance does not allow savings (rate: "
"{savings_rate_pct:.1f}%)."

#: app/insights/messages.py:109
msgid "Los ingresos no superan a los gastos en margen suficiente."
msgstr "Income does not exceed expenses by a sufficient margin."

#: app/insights/messages.py:110
msgid "Prioriza reducir gastos recurrentes o revisa fuentes de ingreso."
msgstr "Prioritize reducing recurring expenses or review sources of income."

#: app/insights/messages.py:116
msgid "Meta de ahorro en riesgo"
msgstr "Savings goal at risk"

#: app/insights/messages.py:117
#, python-brace-format
msgid "La meta \"{goal_name}\" requiere ahorrar {monthly_required:.0f} al mes."
msgstr "The goal \"{goal_name}\" requires saving {monthly_required:.0f} per month."

#: app/insights/messages.py:118
msgid ""
"Tu capacidad de ahorro proyectada no alcanza el ritmo necesario para "
"cumplirla a tiempo."
msgstr ""
"Your projected savings capacity does not reach the necessary pace to meet"
" it on time."

#: app/insights/messages.py:119
msgid ""
"Ajusta el plazo, reduce el objetivo o define un aporte recurrente para "
"esta meta."
msgstr ""
"Adjust the deadline, reduce the objective or define a recurring "
"contribution for this goal."

#: app/insights/messages.py:122
msgid "Meta de ahorro vencida"
msgstr "Overdue savings goal"

#: app/insights/messages.py:123
#, python-brace-format
msgid "La meta \"{goal_name}\" tiene {remaining:.0f} pendiente y ya venció."
msgstr "Goal \"{goal_name}\" has {remaining:.0f} pending and has already expired."

#: app/insights/messages.py:124
msgid "El objetivo no se alcanzó antes de la fecha definida."
msgstr "The objective was not achieved before the defined date."

#: app/insights/messages.py:125
msgid "Actualiza la fecha objetivo o cierra la meta si ya no aplica."
msgstr "Update the target date or close the goal if it no longer applies."

#: app/insights/messages.py:131
msgid "Tendencia de gasto al alza"
msgstr "Rising spending trend"

#: app/insights/messages.py:132
msgid ""
"Tus gastos mensuales muestran una tendencia creciente en los últimos "
"meses."
msgstr "Your monthly expenses show an increasing trend in recent months."

#: app/insights/messages.py:133
msgid "La pendiente positiva sostenida indica un cambio de patrón."
msgstr "The sustained positive slope indicates a change in pattern."

#: app/insights/messages.py:134
msgid "Revisa qué categorías están creciendo más rápido que el resto."
msgstr "Check which categories are growing faster than the rest."

#: app/insights/messages.py:140
msgid "Posible movimiento duplicado"
msgstr "Possible duplicate movement"

#: app/insights/messages.py:141
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Se detectó una transacción muy similar a otra reciente en {category_name}."
msgstr ""
"A transaction very similar to a recent one was detected in "
"{category_name}."

#: app/insights/messages.py:142
msgid ""
"Mismo monto, misma categoría y fecha cercana sugieren un posible "
"duplicado."
msgstr "Same amount, same category and close date suggest a possible duplicate."

#: app/insights/messages.py:143
msgid "Verifica el detalle y elimínalo si corresponde."
msgstr "Check the detail and delete it if applicable."

#: app/insights/messages.py:149
msgid "Configuración inicial pendiente"
msgstr "Initial configuration pending"

#: app/insights/messages.py:150
msgid ""
"Hay elementos básicos sin configurar que mejoran la precisión del "
"análisis."
msgstr ""
"There are basic unconfigured elements that improve the accuracy of the "
"analysis."

#: app/insights/messages.py:151
msgid ""
"Monetra usa el presupuesto y los gastos recurrentes como base de las "
"proyecciones. Sin ellos, las estimaciones son menos precisas."
msgstr ""
"Monetra uses the budget and recurring expenses as the basis for "
"projections. Without them, the estimates are less precise."

#: app/insights/messages.py:152
msgid ""
"Define un presupuesto mensual y registra tus gastos fijos recurrentes "
"(arriendo, servicios, suscripciones)."
msgstr ""
"Define a monthly budget and record your recurring fixed expenses (rent, "
"services, subscriptions)."

