"enviará a tu correo todos los lunes a las 10:00 UTC con los datos del mes"
" y año en curso."
msgstr ""
"With SMTP configured, activate automatic sending of Excel Global. It will"
" be sent to your email every Monday at 10:00 UTC with the data for the "
"current month and year."

#: app/templates/main/guia.html:387
