#: app/templates/partials/announcements/v2_1.html:13
msgid ""
"Una versión más inteligente para entender tu dinero, anticiparte a "
"problemas y tomar mejores decisiones financieras."
msgstr ""
"A smarter version to understand your money, anticipate problems and make "
"better financial decisions."

#: app/templates/partials/announcements/v2_1.html:19
msgid "Cuenta en dólares"
msgstr "Dollar account"

#: app/templates/partials/announcements/v2_1.html:20
msgid ""
"— Registra y administra gastos en USD de forma separada, sin mezclar "
"manualmente tus movimientos."
msgstr ""
"— Record and manage expenses in USD separately, without manually mixing "
"your movements."

#: app/templates/partials/announcements/v2_1.html:24
msgid "Vista consolidada"
msgstr "Consolidated view"

#: app/templates/partials/announcements/v2_1.html:25
msgid ""
"— Consulta tus movimientos locales y en dólares convertidos a una sola "
"moneda para ver tu gasto total real."
msgstr ""
"— Check your local movements and in dollars converted to a single "
"currency to see your real total spending."

#: app/templates/partials/announcements/v2_1.html:29
msgid "Análisis financiero inteligente"
msgstr "Smart financial analysis"

#: app/templates/partials/announcements/v2_1.html:30
msgid ""
"— Monetra revisa ingresos, gastos, presupuesto, recurrentes y metas para "
"entregarte una lectura clara del mes."
msgstr ""
"— Monetra reviews income, expenses, budget, recurring and goals to give "
"you a clear reading of the month."

#: app/templates/partials/announcements/v2_1.html:35
msgid ""
"— Anticipa cómo podrías terminar el mes si mantienes un ritmo parecido al"
" actual."
msgstr ""
"— Anticipate how you could end the month if you maintain a pace similar "
"to the current one."

#: app/templates/partials/announcements/v2_1.html:39
msgid "Alertas financieras claras"
msgstr "Clear financial alerts"

#: app/templates/partials/announcements/v2_1.html:40
msgid ""
"— Recibe avisos sobre presupuesto, déficit, ahorro, metas y movimientos "
"fuera de lo habitual."
msgstr ""
"— Receive notifications about budget, deficit, savings, goals and unusual"
" movements."

#: app/templates/partials/announcements/v2_1.html:44
msgid "Aprendizaje automático"
msgstr "Machine learning"

#: app/templates/partials/announcements/v2_1.html:45
msgid ""
"— Monetra aprende de tu comportamiento financiero y ajusta sus alertas "
"según tu historial disponible."
msgstr ""
"— Monetra learns from your financial behavior and adjusts its alerts "
"based on your available history."

#: app/templates/partials/announcements/v2_1.html:49
msgid "Modo aprendizaje"
msgstr "Learning mode"

#: app/templates/partials/announcements/v2_1.html:50
msgid ""
"— Si eres nuevo, las alertas serán más suaves y orientativas mientras "
"Monetra conoce tus hábitos."
msgstr ""
"— If you are new, the alerts will be softer and more indicative while "
"Monetra learns about your habits."

#: app/templates/partials/announcements/v2_1.html:58
msgid "Importante para la vista consolidada"
msgstr "Important for consolidated view"

#: app/templates/partials/announcements/v2_1.html:61
msgid ""
"Desde Configuración de Cuenta, define el valor de referencia actual del "
"dólar según tu moneda. Así Monetra puede convertir correctamente tus "
"gastos USD y mostrar un consolidado más preciso."
msgstr ""
"From Account Settings, define the current dollar reference value "
"according to your currency. This way Monetra can correctly convert your "
"USD expenses and show a more accurate consolidated statement."

#: app/templates/partials/announcements/v2_1.html:74
msgid "Configurar mi cuenta"
msgstr "Set up my account"

