"Proyección de cierre y Alertas. Por defecto permanece oculto para no "
"saturar la vista principal."
msgstr ""
"— Activate the Financial Health, Closing Projection and Alerts panel from"
" Account Settings. By default it remains hidden so as not to clutter the "
"main view."

#: app/templates/partials/announcements/v2_2.html:24
#: app/templates/partials/announcements/v2_3.html:24
msgid "Mejoras en cargos recurrentes"
msgstr "Improvements in recurring charges"

